  "id": "corpus-05-reporter-calibration",
  "title": "Three-colour reporter calibration and maturation correction",
  "updatedAt": "2026-07-14T12:00:00.000Z",
  "storage": {
    "type": "database",
    "table": "pages",
    "id": "corpus-05-reporter-calibration"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Three-colour reporter calibration and maturation correction"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Directive \u2014 Make the three reporters comparable, so a colour change is not mistaken for an expression change."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Problem"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A three-input gate needs three readouts. "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-4ef35c11",
              "label": "E0040m (GFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-4ef35c11",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E0040m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-359938dd",
              "label": "eBFP2",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-359938dd",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/eBFP2_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " differ in maturation half-life, quantum yield and photostability, so equal protein does not give equal signal."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Design"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each reporter is expressed from the identical context \u2014 "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-525cf33d",
              "label": "J23106",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-525cf33d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23106_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " plus "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "label": "B0034m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0034m_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " plus "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "label": "B0015",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0015_DE",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "label": "DVA_AE",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVA_AE",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " \u2014 so the only variable is the CDS."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Result"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-359938dd",
              "label": "eBFP2",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-359938dd",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/eBFP2_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " reads 4.1-fold lower per unit protein than "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at 30 minutes, converging to 1.6-fold by 90 minutes. That is maturation, not expression."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Consequence: all kinetic comparisons use a single reporter. Cross-colour comparison is only made at steady state, after 120 minutes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What this rules out"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The apparent \"slow arm\" seen in early three-colour pilots is a maturation artefact and not a circuit property. Reported here so it is not rediscovered."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Related entries"
          }
        ]
